IMPORTANT — SCOPE

The 89 files under resource_pack/biomes/ embed a small number of *factual values*
transcribed from the official Minecraft: Bedrock Edition reference pack published
by Mojang AB (see NOTICE for the exact list and attribution). Those values are
game identifiers (biome, sound-event and music-track names) and hexadecimal
colour literals. They are not covered by the MIT grant above, and no Mojang
asset — texture, model, sound, geometry, particle or animation — is contained in,
or redistributed by, this repository.

